WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.502
-This is a story --
"Wine Country." You directed it.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:05.705
You're one of the stars in it,
and it is a story of six women

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
going to Napa
for a birthday party.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it is a -- the six --
the core six, which are you,

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:14.280
Ana Gasteyer, Maya Rudolph
Paula Pell, Emily Spivey, and --

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Rachel Dratch.
-Rachel Dratch.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then also,
Tina Fey's in the film.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And it is --

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:22.856 line:92%
-There are so many funny moments

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there are
so many emotional moments.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
I found myself getting
very choked up

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.862 line:92%
during even the funny moments.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.364 size:78% position:39%
-But you love to cry.
-I do love to cry.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I love to cry.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:35.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I love to cry
when I'm happy.

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:35.702 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Me too. Me too.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm just saying,
the moments where you guys

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:38.405 size:88% position:44% line:92%
were being yourselves --

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:41.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause everybody is kind o
playing a version --

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:41.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's right.
-Yeah.

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:44.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's not a lot of
acting in there.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:44.844 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:45.712 line:92%
I mean, it's not a documentary

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.581
-But I was getting choked up
thinking of how lucky I wa

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:49.616 line:92%
to have spent that much time

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
with these incredibly
talented people.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.787 size:78% position:39%
And it is inspired by
an actual trip, yeah?

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:58.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, we took Dratch
to wine country for her 50th

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:01.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then we went to Ana's --
for Ana's birthday,

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:02.495 size:88% position:44% line:92%
we went to Palm Springs.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
We kind of smashed
some of those trips together

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then, you know,
used creative license

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.535 size:78% position:39%
to write other things
that didn't happen.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:11.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I remember one of my favorite
stories is you --

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:12.338 line:92%
on the flight to the first one

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
you lost your phone
on the plane.

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:17.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
So, I like to plan things,

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.212 line:92%
and I think I'm good at it

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.713 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And so I had basically

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:23.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
the entire trip's itinerar
on my phone.

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:26.086
And then I went in -- and do you
guys -- when you use --

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you put your phone
in your back pocket

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:30.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
and sometimes you go to
the bathroom on the airplane

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you pull your pants down
you know sometimes --

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:34.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yes, right?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.896 line:92%
You're like, "Did I -- did I --"

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:39.265 line:92%
and so, I flushed the toilet

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:42.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was washing my hands
'cause I wash my hands.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:42.936 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like --
I looked for my phone,

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:45.772 line:92%
and I was like, "Oh, my God.

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
I flushed my phone
down the toilet."

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.110 line:92%
And I came out. And this is --

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I screw up,
I get really mad.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:52.612 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.881
-And so I'm like, "I flushed
my phone down the toilet!"

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:55.415 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:56.249 line:92%
And everyone was like, "What?"

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:58.351
And I was like, "I flushed
my phone down the toilet,

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the trip is ruined and all
of the plans are ruined."

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just sat there and jus
like huffed and puffed.

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:05.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"And everything is ruined

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:06.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's not gonna be
a good time."

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:08.361 size:75% position:38%
And everyone's like,
"What's happening?"

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:11.664
And everybody acted exactly ho
you would think they would act

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:16.202
Maya Rudolph, the Earth mother
like, big-hearted, was like,

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Get me some gloves.
I'm gonna look in that toilet.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.406 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:23.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ana Gasteyer,
level-headed, was like,

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:25.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know,
maybe it's in your bag."

00:02:25.512 --> 00:02:28.915 size:81% position:41%
And I was like, "No.
It's down the toilet."

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:29.482 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:31.251 line:92%
Paula Pell, forever supportive

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
was like,
"I need a new phone, too."

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.354 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:38.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So when we land,
we'll both go buy new phones."

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:39.492 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:42.996
And then Emily Spivey,
who is the most hilarious

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:45.632
in times of crisis,
was just looking out the window,

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:49.369
drinking her wine going, "Y'all,
this is my worst nightmare."

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:49.903 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:55.575
"If my phone went in the toilet,
y'all, I would die."

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:57.043 line:92%
And then it was in my bag.

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:59.479 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:01.214 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was in my bag.

